      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY\nDay 16 - Wednesday 15th October, 2025\nCONSTRUCTION OF THE MAIN CARRIAGE WAYS OF OUTER SOUTHERN EXPRESSWAYOSEX FROM RING ROAD I JUNCTION TO RING ROAD II JUNCTION\n\nMotorists using the Apo-Wasa road in the FCT are hereby notified of the above mentioned event and should ensure full compliance to the road design: Inbound (Right hand side) and outbound lane (left hand side).\n\nThe power station near Gudu cementary will be the venue of the event. As such, traffic will be slightly affected during the movement of dignitaries.\n\nTraffic and Security personnel will be deployed accordingly at 0800hr to ensure strict compliance to the road design.\n\nSigned\nHead Traffic, DRTS",
